{"id": "EUVD-2026-48944", "enisaUuid": "a0d4b453-103b-3f7c-9aad-5573b095fb2d", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nksmbd: prevent path traversal bypass by restricting caseless retry\n\nksmbd_vfs_path_lookup() enforces LOOKUP_BENEATH to restrict path\nresolution within the share root. When a crafted path attempts to\nescape the share boundary using parent-directory components ('..'),\nvfs_path_parent_lookup() detects this and immediately fails,\nreturning -EXDEV.\n\nHowever, a bug exists in __ksmbd_vfs_kern_path() under caseless mode.\nThe function fails to intercept the -EXDEV error and erroneously\nfalls through to the caseless retry logic, which is intended only\nfor genuinely missing files. During this retry process, the path\nis reconstructed, leading to an unintended LOOKUP_BENEATH bypass\nthat allows write-capable users to create zero-length files or\ndirectories outside the exported share.\n\nFix this by ensuring that the execution only proceeds to the caseless\nlookup retry when the error is specifically -ENOENT. Any other errors,\nsuch as -EXDEV from a path traversal attempt, must be returned immediately.", "datePublished": "2026-07-25T08:50:43", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:43:22", "baseScore": 8.6, "baseScoreVersion": "3.1", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:L/I:L/A:H", "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/eec1dd2586c4016b7555a5d047db2b3756459fb2", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a1c331d98313380c38f616c8b28b890ec8ef9c28", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cfb5a56c218888f9d74165dff0c282cd0be97983", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/8c9a4f1327eb71efbf14842e7b8a6d965077eb67", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/54bab9ba5a9f156ffa9324fcbe5a356fd0242f95"], "aliases": ["GHSA-cg5c-7728-29v7", "CVE-2026-64400"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.62, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "18176923-08eb-321a-98d9-d5eefe3afd93", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "74d7970febf7e9005375aeda0df821d2edffc9f7 <eec1dd2586c4016b7555a5d047db2b3756459fb2"}, {"id": "19028531-6f3f-3f22-9eb9-680314ae1e65", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "220afd5d-e097-3b1e-8812-c967d1a589e1", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "74d7970febf7e9005375aeda0df821d2edffc9f7 <a1c331d98313380c38f616c8b28b890ec8ef9c28"}, {"id": "36523217-13ab-3366-a58f-684145135a8e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "5.15.145 <5.16"}, {"id": "3d75f5dd-288f-36d5-b7c7-bee176046290", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "74d7970febf7e9005375aeda0df821d2edffc9f7 <cfb5a56c218888f9d74165dff0c282cd0be97983"}, {"id": "41eadfbd-2e1a-3004-9f8a-829ab329a6b4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.4"}, {"id": "509143aa-8604-3b3e-9117-d510b1ac4e47", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6927ffe7479c72e7ebf885507227266a75f7c97d"}, {"id": "5913396e-39d2-3bf8-9cab-3fee893740f4", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.3.10 <6.4"}, {"id": "77b2fca0-c67d-36fc-b34f-11b2101471d3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "83f1c770-51c3-37a4-8457-5cb9dfe1b4c6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.114"}, {"id": "9dc80415-ee06-3478-abd2-1f62690e41dd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.57"}, {"id": "adf87945-2ac4-3385-ba22-614d50e284fe", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.4"}, {"id": "c0631743-890f-304a-b73e-32740ea571bb", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "019aae488dbc67c97a33db03652e20e2c9e3afa7"}, {"id": "c6c02378-39b8-333c-8ef4-9cc80f0bb143", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "6.1.71 <6.2"}, {"id": "cdf98f36-58b6-3e3b-bd3b-63fe0827d865", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}, {"id": "dd2775de-ad6f-3f8e-bcd9-d5d2ea93e917", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "74d7970febf7e9005375aeda0df821d2edffc9f7 <54bab9ba5a9f156ffa9324fcbe5a356fd0242f95"}, {"id": "e65e78f5-a04e-328a-b59b-941c93e4b91b", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "ef6cc1c465786b3e4e735d1ab8b616b3e94402df"}, {"id": "f716e4ea-bced-3f2b-9e22-cc7a0586b9f3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "74d7970febf7e9005375aeda0df821d2edffc9f7 <8c9a4f1327eb71efbf14842e7b8a6d965077eb67"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "187c3581-c785-39cc-938d-1ee86f7eb206", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}